# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# ZyraVision — Docker Context Exclusions
# Reduz contexto de build de ~2.8 GB para ~5 MB
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Version Control ─────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ─── Dependencies (instaladas no container) ──────
node_modules
vendor

# ─── IDE / Editor ────────────────────────────────
.cursor
.claude
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Environment / Secrets ───────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Storage / Logs / Cache ──────────────────────
storage/logs/*
storage/framework/cache/*
storage/framework/sessions/*
storage/framework/views/*
storage/app/*
bootstrap/cache/*

# ─── Build Artifacts ─────────────────────────────
public/build
public/hot

# ─── Documentation ───────────────────────────────
docs
*.md
LICENSE

# ─── Mobile App (Flutter — nao roda no backend) ──
mobile

# ─── Tests ───────────────────────────────────────
tests
phpunit.xml
.phpunit.result.cache

# ─── Frontend Build Config (nao necessario no PHP)
postcss.config.js
tailwind.config.js
vite.config.ts
tsconfig.json
package.json
package-lock.json

# ─── Docker (evita recursao) ─────────────────────
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile

# ─── OS Files ────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─── Misc ────────────────────────────────────────
scripts
exporting
sending
resolve
transferring
